orbitra-ratvar-test-description = Configure test mode for your Ratvar cult.
orbitra-ratvar-test-help = orbitra_ratvar_test on [tier 1-3] [energy 0-10000] | orbitra_ratvar_test off
orbitra-ratvar-test-player = Control a character with active Fun administrator privileges.
orbitra-ratvar-test-grant-failed = Could not grant membership: requires a living human with a mind, no incompatible role and no mind protection. Ended cults cannot restart.
orbitra-ratvar-test-failed = No active cult, or configuration is out of range.
orbitra-ratvar-test-enabled = Test cult: tier { $tier }, energy { $energy }. Scriptures and ark activation require one participant; the 20-minute gate is disabled. Create structures through scriptures. WARNING: the real finale can damage the station and end the round!
orbitra-ratvar-test-disabled = Test overrides disabled. Normal progression and requirements restored. Granted resources and roles remain; an ongoing ark defence is not cancelled.
